msgstr "არასწორი ინტეგრირებული არხი: {channel}"

#: integrated_channels/integrated_channel/management/commands/cleanup_duplicate_assignment_records.py:39
#: integrated_channels/integrated_channel/management/commands/transmit_learner_data.py:37
#: integrated_channels/integrated_channel/management/commands/transmit_subsection_learner_data.py:37
